      "description": "First project parser statement that creates the vulnerability-relevant ownership state. Once the witness token stream reaches `LABEL` inside `SCALEBAR`, `loadScalebar()` parses directly into the embedded `scalebar->label` field, so later allocations and frees operate on an owner-managed object that `msFreeMap()` will revisit on error cleanup."
